---
import { currentProgram as program } from "../data/currentProgram";
import { courseCopy } from "../data/courseCopy";
interface Props { language?: "en" | "zh-CN" }
const { language = "en" } = Astro.props;
const chinese = language === "zh-CN";
const copy = courseCopy[language];
---

<section class="current-program wrap" aria-labelledby="current-program-title">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">
      {copy.season} · {copy.audience} · {program.classes}{chinese ? " 节课" : " classes"}
    </p>
    <h2 id="current-program-title" lang="en">{program.name}</h2>
    <p>
      {chinese ? `从简短、可尝试的表达挑战开始。${program.units} 个单元，每单元 ${program.classesPerUnit} 节课，从主题或角色出发，逐步搭建并呈现内容；平时练习 ${program.practiceSeconds[0]}–${program.practiceSeconds[1]} 秒演讲，并在支持下完成 ${program.showcaseMinutes} 分钟期末展示。` : `Short, achievable speaking challenges. ${program.description}`}
    </p>
  </div>
  <a class="button" href={chinese ? `/zh${program.href}` : program.href}
    >{chinese ? "了解课程" : "Explore the course"} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
  >
</section>
